{"id":"n44199-1-9","stage":3,"title":"담요 · 毯子","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n44199-1-9-1","ko":"바닥에 깔 담요 한 장 주세요.","zh":"请给我一条铺在地板上的毯子。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바닥에","meaning":"地板","explanation":"바닥：地板；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바닥","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62696","senseId":"4","lemma":"바닥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바닥에","audio":"/audio/2a0877f2b7ca0b120f73.mp3"}},{"text":"깔","meaning":"铺","explanation":"깔다：铺；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"깔다","audio":"/audio/5c50a6aedfdc736d9252.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32553","senseId":"1","lemma":"깔다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깔","audio":"/audio/25193f6c3aff13b52373.mp3"}},{"text":"담요","meaning":"毯子，毛毯","explanation":"담요：毯子，毛毯","readings":[{"term":"담요","audio":"/audio/989e871fdd7d2dee7efe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44199","senseId":"1","lemma":"담요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"담요","audio":"/audio/989e871fdd7d2dee7efe.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"장","meaning":"一条（毯子的量词）","explanation":"장：量词，计算宽薄物品；本句“一条毯子”","readings":[{"term":"장","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29607","senseId":"1","lemma":"장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"18c3f3f4b810aab6","term":"바닥","zh":"地板","audio":"/audio/18c3f3f4b810aab6c28b.mp3","entryId":"62696","definition":"建筑物内部的下面部分。","pronunciation":["바닥"]},{"id":"5c50a6aedfdc736d","term":"깔다","zh":"铺","audio":"/audio/5c50a6aedfdc736d9252.mp3","entryId":"32553","definition":"把东西在地面上摊平。","pronunciation":["깔다"]},{"id":"989e871fdd7d2dee","term":"담요","zh":"毯子，毛毯","audio":"/audio/989e871fdd7d2dee7efe.mp3","entryId":"44199","definition":"用毛线等编织成的可以盖或铺的薄被子。","pronunciation":["담ː뇨"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"2dfdb434387c361c","term":"장","zh":"量词，计算宽薄物品；本句“一条毯子”","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3","entryId":"29607","definition":"量词，计算宽薄物品；本句“一条毯子”","pronunciation":["장"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/669e222c04387f105261.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n44199-1-9-2","ko":"저기 장롱에 있으니 꺼내 가세요.","zh":"在那边的衣柜里，您拿去用吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"장롱에","meaning":"箱子，柜子，箱柜","explanation":"장롱：箱子，柜子，箱柜；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"장롱","audio":"/audio/0533c672106599ec2794.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73402","senseId":"1","lemma":"장롱","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장롱에","audio":"/audio/3835fa7e1fab0fa23fce.mp3"}},{"text":"있으니","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","